@node Testing
@chapter Testing

@cindex testing
@cindex ERT

The package includes 160 tests: 122 for the core, 16 for the navigation
menu, 8 for the browser dashboard, and 14 for the subtree note
generator.  The second and third groups run with
@command{make test-nav} and @command{make test-html}.  The tests of the
subtree note generator are in
@file{test-autoslip-subtree-notes-generator.el} and are loaded like the
other test files.

@section Running Tests

@subsection From Command Line

@example
# Run all tests
make test

# Run unit tests only
make test-unit

# Run integration tests
make test-integration

# Run with verbose output
make test-verbose
@end example

@subsection From Within Emacs

@example
M-x ert RET t RET
@end example

Or load and run specific categories:

@lisp
(load-file "test-autoslip-roam.el")
(ert-run-tests-interactively "^test-parse")
@end lisp

